<title>USA: Rainforest Cafe approves stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Rainforest Cafe approves stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rainforest Cafe Inc said its board of directors approved a plan to repurchase up to one million shares of its common stock over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>Shares may be purchased from time to time through open market purchases including option writing transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Rainforest Cafe develops, owns and operates combination restaurant/retail facilities.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
